  data: {
    LLM: 'Six cards each. One round of bidding (2 to 4); high bidder names trump and leads. Follow suit; may trump when void (in some variants may trump while holding led suit). Four points per hand: High (ace of trump), Low (deuce of trump), Jack (trick with jack of trumps), Game (side with more card points in tricks: A=4 K=3 Q=2 J=1 10=10). First team to reach target (e.g. 15 or 21) wins.',
